"Creating an application-scoped bean that implements one of these interfaces and annotating it with `@PersistenceUnitExtension`\n"
"(or `@PersistenceUnitExtension(\"nameOfYourPU\")` for a <<multiple-persistence-units,named persistence unit>>)\n"
"will automatically register it with the corresponding persistence unit."
msgstr ""

msgid "Here is an example of a custom function contributor:"
msgstr ""

